{"id":"caracteristiques-dels-llenguatges-de-marques","title":"Característiques dels llenguatges de marques","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":60,"backlinks":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Aquests llenguatges utilitzen etiquetes d&#39;obertura i tancament (com <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> i <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>) per envoltar el contingut. També permeten l&#39;ús d&#39;atributs per donar informació extra (com l&#39;<code>href</code> en un enllaç) i requereixen un anidament correcte: la darrera etiqueta oberta ha de ser la primera a tancar-se.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Hola <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>&gt;</span>món<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 380] <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://www.ejemplo.com&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Anar al web&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Visitar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 383]</code></pre></div>"}